            0.615
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Fig. 6.1: Objects around us"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.621,
            0.743,
            0.663
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Which property did you use to group the objects in Activity 6.2?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.666,
            0.743,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Did your friends group objects based on similar properties?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.71,
            0.565,
            0.731
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What did you learn from this activity?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.736,
            0.743,
            0.797
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You must have noticed that an object can be made from different materials and some materials can be used to make more than one object."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.798,
            0.743,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The method of arranging the objects into groups is called "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "classification",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ". Objects can be classified on the basis of a common property that they have."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.859,
            0.743,
            0.901
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Similarly, we can classify materials based on certain properties."
            }
          ]
        },
